category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libexpat-devel
sdesc: "Logging for C Library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Log4c is a C language library for flexible logging to files, syslog and other
destinations. It is modeled after the Log for Java library (log4j), staying as
close to their API as is reasonable."
skip:

homepage: https://sourceforge.net/projects/log4c/
license: LGPL-2.1-or-later AND MIT
